From 1060a098d50dc39ca8afc3cf8ad3679ea976dbb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:26:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] One quality gate for every question, direct-question
 forms, concept-aware repeats

- services/questionQuality.js: clarity, context, meaningful blank, four distinct
  non-overlapping options, ambiguity, correctness and alignment checks; theory
  command word, named subject, model answer, key points; repairs small faults
- testEngine: every draft (AI or rules) validated; discards keep their reasons;
  direct MCQs (identify, acronym) before blanks; self-contained cloze sentences;
  theory forms example / working / advantages and limitations; distractors never
  inside each other; AI drafts always backed by rule drafts
- pickFresh: duplicates by wording, meaning (embedding model) and concept;
  concepts of the last two tests give way to untested ones
- routes/tests: recent-test repeat policy, concept history, one build at a time
  per student and subject
- tests: questionPipeline.test.mjs (76 checks)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GhijJrzThGCi37PyEvEnT
